                "metadata": {
                    "author": "The Wiggles",
                    "category": "music",
                    "description": "Drift into a dreamy world of calm with Piano Lullabies for Baby Sleep—a gentle, instrumental collection from The Wiggles, created in response to heartfelt requests from parents and carers. Thoughtfully crafted to soothe babies, toddlers, and even grown-ups, this album features soft piano renditions of timeless lullabies like Rockabye Baby, You Are My Sunshine, Hush Little Baby, and Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star.  \n\nEach melody is delicately played to create a peaceful atmosphere, perfect for naptime, bedtime, or quiet moments throughout the day. Whether you're settling your little one or simply seeking a moment of calm, these lullabies offer a comforting soundtrack for rest and relaxation.  \n\n“We understand firsthand the challenge of settling babies and toddlers to sleep, which is why we created this album. Our hope is that these gentle piano melodies offer a soothing solution for parents and carers, providing a peaceful pathway to bedtime for families everywhere” – Lachy Wiggle.",
                    "audioPreviewUrl": "https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/cards/et4Rr/preview piano lullabies for baby sleep-1.mp3",
